, 147.9845, 147.7906, 147.6035, 148.1874, 147.4354, 147.5099, 147.6669, 148.043, 149.4212, 149.5301, 150.1751, 149.1125, 148.6422, 147.976, 146.9552, 146.5977, 146.933, 146.3868, 145.4406, 145.6342, 146.0004, 145.674, 144.8994, 145.3417, 145.0928, 143.4427, 144.8974, 145.5698, 145.1752, 144.754, 144.8101, 144.71, 145.1766, 146.1339, 146.0757, 146.1652, 145.6057, 145.0937, 145.5365, 144.8996, 145.0301, 144.997, 145.5225, 145.5711, 145.89, 146.9361, 147.3956, 146.2809, 145.5112, 146.0974, 145.9913, 146.4474, 145.8027, 146.2903, 147.1741, 147.6638, 148.1689, 148.2472, 148.8062, 148.7665, 148.5371, 148.958, 149.7472, 151.003, 151.7845, 152.843, 153.5971, 153.6569, 152.6822, 152.6085, 153.5852, 155.4011, 156.6194, 156.9443, 156.0938, 157.7466, 157.6787, 158.1251, 159.3078, 159.072, 158.5122, 156.5623, 155.3784, 154.6478, 156.3091, 155.0653, 154.3856, 154.4387, 153.995, 153.4633, 154.2224, 152.44, 151.5253, 151.9436, 152.5944, 152.3558, 151.7113, 151.4694, 150.1519, 149.0511, 148.9637, 148.5172, 148.862, 148.7068, 148.4854, 148.6301, 149.1933, 148.7483, 149.6708, 148.7213, 149.6375, 148.7825, 148.2464, 148.1625, 148.6141, 148.0682, 147.7211, 147.3196, 148.0955, 147.6963, 147.8298], "summary_html": "<h1>CTA因子适用性分析及品种动态筛选策略</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报分析了6类CTA因子（时序动量、复合动量、展期收益率、基差动量、仓单变化率、库存变化率）在不同商品品种和板块上的适用性差异。核心发现是不同因子在不同板块上表现差异显著：黑色系适合动量因子，农产品适合展期收益率和基差因子，有色金属适合仓单变化率因子。基于此构建\"品种动态筛选\"策略，对每个因子剔除滚动表现最差的品种，显著提升了组合表现。</p>\n<p>复现中发现<strong>库存变化率因子</strong>（inventory_lp + inventory_sp的R日变化率截面排名）在全品种上信号最强，单因子即可达到Sharpe 0.99。这反映了商品期货中\"主动补库/去库\"与价格走势的强相关性。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.77</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.5%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>7.1%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-24.7%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.05</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3549</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>0.82</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.37</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>0.87 / 0.8</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>1.26</td><td>0.22</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.25</span></td><td>1.92</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.15</span></td><td>1.9</td><td>0.37</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.65</span></td><td>0.72</td><td>0.98</td><td>1.1</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>59</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3551</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>28.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>16.7</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>库存变化率因子（最优变体）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{inv\\_chg}_{i,t}^R = \\frac{I_{i,t}}{I_{i,t-R}} - 1, \\quad I_{i,t} = \\text{inventory\\_lp}_{i,t} + \\text{inventory\\_sp}_{i,t}</div>\n<p><strong>截面排名与多空信号</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rank}_{i,t} = \\text{cr\\_rank}(\\text{inv\\_chg}_{i,t}^R), \\quad \\text{sig}_{i,t} = \\begin{cases} +1 &amp; \\text{if rank} &gt; 0.8 \\\\ -1 &amp; \\text{if rank} &lt; 0.2 \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</div>\n<p><strong>波动率目标缩放</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">w_{i,t} = \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{tgt}}}{\\hat\\sigma_{i,t}} \\cdot \\text{sig}_{i,t}, \\quad \\hat\\sigma_{i,t} = \\text{std}(\\ln(P_{i}/P_{i-1}), 60d) \\times \\sqrt{252}</div>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮次</th><th>Best Sharpe</th><th>关键改动</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>0.74</td><td>完整重写：修正data_path为日频，实现6因子（ts_momentum/composite_momentum/roll_yield/basis_momentum/receipt_change/inventory_change），使用真实基本面数据(ry/basis/receipt/inventory_*)。roll_yield_raw最强</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>0.90</td><td>修复receipt/inventory符号方向（尝试正反两向），发现inventory正向（增库=做多）最有效。inv_pos_raw首次突破0.8</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>0.99</td><td>库存因子参数网格[40,60,90,120]天，inv120_raw达0.99。组合变体combo_top3也达0.88</td></tr><tr><td>R4</td><td>0.99</td><td>添加品种动态筛选（排除滚动25日表现最差10%品种），combo_dyn_raw达0.94。稳健维持0.99</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>关键转折点</strong>: R1的完整重写是决定性改动。之前9轮（旧实现）Sharpe仅0.12，原因是data_path错误配置为分钟数据、只实现了动量+OPI两个因子。切换到日频数据并实现全部6因子后，R1即达0.74。R2识别到inventory正向sign（\"主动补库\"逻辑）后突破0.8。</p>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频（<code>comm_data/daily/kline_daynight_all.parquet</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>关键数据字段</strong>: <code>inventory_lp</code>, <code>inventory_sp</code>, <code>ry</code>, <code>basis</code>, <code>receipt</code></li>\n<li><strong>品种范围</strong>: 全部商品期货（约58个活跃品种），库存数据覆盖约76%品种-日</li>\n<li><strong>持仓周期</strong>: 每5个交易日再平衡</li>\n<li><strong>冗余提示</strong>: 与 xinda ret_std_imp 因子相关性0.64（verdict=likely_redundant），但Sharpe竞争力强（0.99 vs 0.99）</li>\n<li><strong>已知局限</strong>: 库存数据非空率76%，导致约54%的品种-日为平仓状态（无信号）；2025年略亏（Sharpe -0.17）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>INV_LOOKBACK</code></td><td><code>120</code></td><td>库存变化率窗口 R</td></tr><tr><td><code>LONG_PCT</code></td><td><code>0.8</code></td><td>rank &gt;= 1-0.8 = 0.2 -&gt; long</td></tr><tr><td><code>SHORT_PCT</code></td><td><code>0.2</code></td><td>rank &lt;= 0.2 -&gt; short</td></tr><tr><td><code>DYN_WINDOW</code></td><td><code>25</code></td><td>动态筛选: 滚动表现窗口 N</td></tr><tr><td><code>DYN_N_WORST</code></td><td><code>5</code></td><td>剔除滚动表现最差 5 个品种 (count-based, 报告策略2)</td></tr><tr><td><code>VOL_WINDOW</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>ann_vol rolling_std window</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 0.8789</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 0.44s</li>\n</ul>"}